return {
  ["creature.zakya-rakshasa.erlw2014"]={title="Zakya Rakshasa",subtitle="Criatura - ERLW - 2014",body="Pagina: 309\n\n=== ESTATISTICAS ===\n\nTipo/Tamanho: fiend / M\n\nCR: 5\n\nCA: 18\n\nPV: 59 (7d8 + 28)\n\nDeslocamento: walk: 30\n\nSTR 18 | DEX 14 | CON 18 | INT 12 | WIS 13 | CHA 11\n\nPericias: \n\nSentidos: darkvision 60 ft.\n\nIdiomas: Common, Infernal\n\nResistencias: \n\nVulnerabilidades: \n\n=== TRACOS ===\n\nLimited Magic Immunity\n\nThe rakshasa can't be affected or detected by spells of 1st level or lower unless it wishes to be. It has advantage on saving throws against all other spells and magical effects.\n\nMagic Weapons\n\nThe rakshasa's weapon attacks are magical.\n\nMartial Prowess (1/Turn)\n\nWhen the rakshasa hits a creature with a melee weapon attack, the attack deals an extra 11 (2d10) damage of the weapon's type, and the creature must make a 15 Strength saving throw. On a failure, the rakshasa can push the creature up to 10 feet away from it, knock the creature prone, or make the creature drop one item it is holding of the rakshasa's choice.\n\n=== CONJURACAO ===\n\nInnate Spellcasting\n\n=== ACOES ===\n\nMultiattack\n\nThe rakshasa makes three melee weapon attacks. Alternatively, it can make two ranged attacks with its javelins.\n\nLongsword\n\nmw 7 to hit, reach 5 ft., one target. h8 (1d8 + 4) slashing damage, or 9 (1d10 + 4) slashing damage if used with two hands.\n\nJavelin\n\nmw,rw 7 to hit, reach 5 ft. or range 30/120 ft., one target. h7 (1d6 + 4) piercing damage."},
  ["creature.zala-morphus.kftgv2014"]={title="Zala Morphus",subtitle="Criatura - KftGV - 2014",body="Pagina: 47\n\n=== ESTATISTICAS ===\n\nIdiomas: Common, Deep Speech, Elvish"},
  ["creature.zalkore.toa2014"]={title="Zalkoré",subtitle="Criatura - ToA - 2014",body="Pagina: 79\n\n=== ESTATISTICAS ==="},
  ["creature.zaltember.skt2014"]={title="Zaltember",subtitle="Criatura - SKT - 2014",body="Pagina: 180\n\n=== ESTATISTICAS ===\n\nTipo/Tamanho: giant / L\n\nCR: 1\n\nCA: 13\n\nPV: 30 (4d10 + 8)\n\nDeslocamento: walk: 30\n\nSTR 17 | DEX 10 | CON 14 | INT 10 | WIS 10 | CHA 10\n\nIdiomas: Common, Giant\n\nImunidades: fire\n\n=== ACOES ===\n\nBattleaxe\n\nmw 5 to hit, reach 5 ft., one target. h12 (2d8 + 3) slashing damage, or 14 (2d10 + 3) slashing damage if used with two hands.\n\nJavelin\n\nmw,rw 5 to hit, reach 5 ft. or range 30/120 ft., one target. h10 (2d6 + 3) piercing damage."},
  ["creature.zalthar-shadowdusk.wdmm2014"]={title="Zalthar Shadowdusk",subtitle="Criatura - WDMM - 2014",body="Pagina: 286\n\n=== ESTATISTICAS ===\n\nIdiomas: Abyssal, Common, Deep Speech"},
